      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Materialization:   \u2b21 agent skills (~/.claude/skills/)\nMode:               \u2461 deterministic workflow (archetype: dpe-cf, dpe-sa, dq, dd)\nSystem of record:   project-scoped Neo4j knowledge graph (DCAT \u00b7 DQV \u00b7 SHACL \u00b7 PROV-O)\nHITL:               5 review surfaces \u2014 descriptions, mappings, domain rules, escalations, unmapped columns",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Materialization:   \u2b21 agent skills (~/.claude/skills/)\nMode:               \u2461 deterministic workflow (archetype: dpe-cf, dpe-sa, dq, dd)\nSystem of record:   project-scoped Neo4j knowledge graph (DCAT \u00b7 DQV \u00b7 SHACL \u00b7 PROV-O)\nHITL:               5 review surfaces \u2014 descriptions, mappings, domain rules, escalations, unmapped columns",
